            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.12+REV.21.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 21.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Magi aye bibedo dogcel ma gidonyo kwede i gaŋ. Yo tuŋ acam gipimo romo yadi alip adek ki miya aryo ki pyeraryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Reuben, dogcel pa Juda, ki dogcel pa Levi. Dogcel me gaŋ onoŋo gicako nyiŋgi ki nyiŋ kaka pa Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo tuŋ wokceŋ bene onoŋo gipimo yadi alip adek ki miya aryo ki pyeraryo, Onoŋo bene tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Yucepu, dogcel pa Benjamin, ki dogcel pa Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo tuŋ acuc bene gipimo oromo yadi alip adek ki miya aryo ki pyeraryo. Onoŋo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Cimeon, dogcel pa Icakar, ki dogcel pa Jabulon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me agikkine yo tuŋ potoceŋ gipimo oromo yadi alip adek ki miya aryo ki pyeraryo. Onoŋo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Gad, dogcel pa Acer, ki dogcel pa Naputali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ bor pa cel murumo gaŋ ducu onoŋo romo yadi alip apar wiye aryo, ki miya aboro ki pyeraboro. Cakke i kare man cito kwede anyim, nyiŋ gaŋ doŋ gibilwoŋo ni, Rwot tye kany.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
